STATEMENT OF MODIFICATIONS (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b))
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following files have been modified from the original work:

  section-1/*/src/main/resources/application.properties
      Repointed from the OpenAI API to the NVIDIA NIM API. Changed base-url,
      api-key (OPENAI_API_KEY -> NVIDIA_API_KEY) and model-name (gpt-4o ->
      nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b). Set quarkus.langchain4j.timeout to 2m
      in every step: the 10s default is not enough once the model reasons over a
      tool schema or a RAG-augmented prompt, and the timeout surfaces as a dead
      WebSocket rather than as an error. Added snippet region markers (#--8<--)
      so the decks can quote a named part of a file.

  section-1/step-05/pom.xml
  section-1/step-05/src/main/resources/application.properties
      Added the in-process ONNX embedding model
      (langchain4j-embeddings-bge-small-en-q) and declared the embedding-model
      provider. Without this, RAG ingestion would fall back to the OpenAI
      embedding model, which does not exist in the NVIDIA catalogue.

  section-1/step-07, step-08, step-09, step-10
      src/main/java/dev/langchain4j/quarkus/workshop/BookingRepository.java
      src/main/java/dev/langchain4j/quarkus/workshop/Exceptions.java
      Added a createBooking tool and the BookingCannotBeCreatedException it
      raises, so the workshop shows the model writing to the database and not
      only reading from it and deleting. The tool validates the arguments the
      model chose, which is the teaching point: those arguments are untrusted
      input.

  section-1/step-09/src/main/resources/application.properties
      Removed an observability block that configured extensions this step does
      not have. Quarkus reported three unrecognized configuration keys for it.
      The same block carried a hardcoded placeholder credential
      (quarkus.otel.exporter.otlp.traces.headers=authorization=Bearer ...).

  section-1/step-10/pom.xml
      Added quarkus-micrometer-registry-prometheus so that /q/metrics is
      reachable locally. The upstream setup exports metrics over OTLP only,
      which leaves no way to read them outside Grafana.

  section-1/step-10/src/main/java/dev/langchain4j/quarkus/workshop/CustomerSupportAgent.java
      Raised @Timeout from 5000 to 60000 and lowered @Retry from three attempts
      to one. Measured end to end, the guarded, RAG-augmented call lands around
      34s, so the original budget was unreachable and the fallback fired on
      every request. Retrying three times against a rate-limited endpoint turns
      a timeout into a 429.

  section-1/step-10/src/main/resources/application.properties
      Added a console log format carrying traceId and spanId, so a request can
      be followed from the terminal into Tempo.

  pom.xml
      New aggregator limited to the Section 1 modules.

  Across the tree, whitespace only: a trailing newline was added at end of file
  and trailing spaces were removed. No content changed.

